{"result":"{
  "id": "18165",
  "key": "SFCC-103",
  "summary": "Search – Index & Attribute Configuration Foundation",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18165",
  "description": "**As a** Site Admin\n**I want** the SFCC search index configured with the correct searchable, refinable, and sortable attributes, synonym dictionaries, and redirect rules,\n**so that** all search and filter surfaces across the storefront have a reliable, correctly structured data foundation to build on.\n\n----\n\nThis is a foundational configuration story. No search results page, autocomplete, filter panel, or sorting surface can be built or tested until this work is complete.",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Refinement",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "Medium"
  },
  "assignee": {
