{
  "id": "17851",
  "key": "SFCC-25",
  "summary": "Product Type and Variation Model",
  "description": "**As a** Site Admin,\n**I want** the SFCC product type and variation model configured,\n**so that** Zimmermann products with multiple colours and sizes are correctly structured before any product data is loaded.\n\n----\n\nSFCC uses a strict three-level product hierarchy:\n\n  - **Master product* — shared attributes (name, style code, description); not purchasable\n  - **Variation group* — groups variants by colour; holds colour-level attributes and images\n  - **Variant (SKU)* — purchasable unit; unique colour + size combination with its own price and inventory",
