  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to see relevant badges on a product (such as Campaign, Runway, Exclusive, Online Exclusive, and VIC Exclusive),\n\n**so that** I can quickly identify the nature of a product when browsing its detail page.\n\n----\n\nBadges are displayed on the PDP. A product can carry multiple badges simultaneously — when more than one applies, a defined priority hierarchy determines display order. Badges are clickable on the PDP and navigate the shopper to the relevant category PLP. Badge creation and assignment is covered in a separate user story [SFCC-225](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-225).\n\n\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260716-034444.png\"](image-20260716-034444.png)",
