      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 Hey Emma, \n1. I couldn’t find any confirmation message in the designs for adding to wishlist on PDP other than that the icon will be in the selected state. \n2. Okay, that is not how we have the requirements written - I based it on this: \n\n  - **CRM-127*: the system will only allow one size per product to be saved to the wishlist.\n  - **CRM-128*: the system will not allow the customer to add a product in a different size if that product is already saved.\n\nThis is also how the current site behaves but let me know if that view has changed. And then we need to have a think how the design is going to work - deselecting the wishlist icon removes from bag - so we’d have to reset the wishlist icon status upon size selection change. Do you want me to log an enhancement for this?",
