  "summary": "Search – Exact Match & Spell Correction Blocklist Configuration",
  "description": "**As a** Site Merchandiser, \n\n**I want** exact match terms and spell correction blocklist terms configured in the SFCC search platform \n\n**so that** specific queries return only precise matches where needed, and intentional search terms are not incorrectly auto-corrected.\n\n----\n\nThe following terms are currently configured in Athos Commerce (Searchspring) and must be configured in SFCC. No FRs are attached to these features — configuration is based on current Athos data extracted August 2026. Depends on SFCC-103 (Search Index & Attribute Configuration Foundation).\n\n**Exact Match terms by storefront:**\n\n|Storefront|Terms|\n|---|---|\n|AE-EN|post, posts|\n|AU|silk scarf|\n|EU-CH|silk scarf|\n|EU-FR|post, posts|\n|EU-IT|post, posts|\n|HK|post, posts|\n\nCA-EN, EU, EU-ES, UK, US — no exact match terms configured; no action required.\n\n**Spell Correction Blocklist terms by storefront:**\n\n|Storefront|Terms|\n|---|---|\n|AU|lounge|\n\nAll other storefronts — empty blocklist; no action required.",
