  "key": "SFCC-683",
  "summary": "Search – Synonym Dictionary & Query Replacement Configuration",
  "description": "\\*\\*As a\\*\\* Site Merchandiser,\n\\*\\*I want\\*\\* the synonym dictionaries and query replacement rules from the current Athos/Magento search indexes configured into the SFCC search configuration,\n\\*\\*so that\\*\\* shoppers continue to find products using the same search terms and language variants they use today.\n----\nThis story depends on SFCC-103 (Search Index & Attribute Configuration Foundation) being complete before configuration can be tested.\nAll source data is documented in full on Confluence: [Search — Synonym & Query Replacement Source Data - Adobe SFCC - Confluence](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/401932289/SearchSynonymQueryReplacementSource+Data)\nConfiguration rules:\n- All synonym groups and query replacement rules marked enabled must be migrated as-is\n- Disabled groups and rules must not be migrated\n- Content changes to any synonym or query replacement rule are out of scope for this story and require a separate BM task\n\\*Synonym groups by storefront:\\*\n|Athos Index|Storefront|Enabled|Disabled|Total|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|au|AU|69|0|69|\n|us|US-Dom|18|0|18|\n|caen|US-Int|15|0|15|\n|uk|UK|16|0|16|\n|eu|EU-Dom (EN)|40|0|40|\n|eufr|EU-Dom (FR)|41|2|43|\n|euit|EU-Dom (IT)|43|5|48|\n|eues|EU-Dom (ES)|57|4|61|\n|euch|EU-Int|55|0|55|\n|hk|HK|11|0|11|\n|aeen|ME|25|0|25|\n|Total| |390|11|401|\n\\*Query replacement rules by storefront:\\*\n|Athos Index|Storefront|Enabled|Disabled|Total|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|au|AU|11|0|11|\n|us|US-Dom|12|0|12|\n|caen|US-Int|10|0|10|\n|uk|UK|13|0|13|\n|eu|EU-Dom (EN)|28|2|30|\n|eufr|EU-Dom (FR)|7|4|11|\n|euit|EU-Dom (IT)|9|2|11|\n|eues|EU-Dom (ES)|9|2|11|\n|euch|EU-Int|9|0|9|\n|hk|HK|11|0|11|\n|aeen|ME|8|0|8|\n|Total| |117|10|127|\nNote: EU-Dom (EN) has an extended set of multilingual query replacement rules covering terms in French, Italian, Spanish, and other European languages, mapping them to English product terms.",
