{"result":"{
  "id": "19162",
  "key": "SFCC-723",
  "summary": "pdp/hero",
  "description": "As a Developer, \n\nI want a reusable `pdp/hero` React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \n\nso that it can be used as the top-level orchestration component for the PDP, composing the product image gallery and `pdp/product-content` into a single, responsive hero layout.\n\n----\n\nThe component is responsible for layout and composition only — it does not own the interaction logic of its child components. It accepts child components as composed instances (e.g. carousel, `pdp/product-content`, colour picker, size selector, add-to-bag, drawer triggers) and manages their arrangement across desktop and mobile breakpoints. The sole configuration prop is `showGalleryButton` (boolean), which controls whether the \"View Gallery\" CTA button overlay appears on the image gallery.",
  "status": {
    "name": "To Do",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "High"
  },
