rough the pdp/hero, when focus moves through the component, then focus order follows the visual reading order: gallery first on desktop (left), product content second (right); stacked top-to-bottom on mobile.\n11. The component meets WCAG 2.1 AA as the minimum accessibility standard; child component accessibility is covered in their respective stories."
