  "summary": "pdp/size-selector",
  "description": "As a Developer, I want a reusable `pdp/size-selector` React component built to the Zimmermann design system spec, so that it can be consumed by PDP and any other page-level stories that require size selection.\n\nThe component should be built as a standalone PWA Kit React component, sourced from the Zimmermann Design System 2026 Figma file. It renders a size selector UI displaying available sizes with their stock status. It does not handle inventory API integration — stock status is passed in as props. For one-size products, the standard selector UI is suppressed and replaced with a plain \"One size\" label.",
