  "description": "As a Developer, I want a reusable product-card-group React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, so that it can render a labelled group of product cards across multiple pages including PDP, PLP, and Homepage.\n\nThe component renders a section header with an optional SHOP ALL link and a row of ProductCard atoms. It does not own the product data or navigation logic — it receives a product array and a label as props. The number of cards displayed is controlled by the Display prop (2, 3, or 4). Examples of usage include More from this category and Recommended for you on the PDP. The component does not need to know where its data comes from — whether that is SFCC merchandising logic, a Contentful-curated editorial slot, or a personalisation engine is irrelevant to the component.",
