  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "Layout\n\n1. Given the component renders on desktop, then it displays product cards in a single row with 2, 3, or 4 cards depending on the Display prop.\n2. Given the component renders on mobile, then it displays product cards in the appropriate mobile layout per the design system spec for the given Display value.\n3. Given a section label is provided, then it renders as a heading above the card row.\n4. Given a SHOP ALL link is provided, then it renders aligned to the right of the section header and navigates to the relevant category or collection URL.\n5. Given no SHOP ALL link is provided, then the header renders without it.\n\nProduct cards\n\n6. Given the component renders, then each product card renders using the ProductCard atom per the design system spec.\n7. Given fewer products are provided than the Display value, then the component renders only the available cards without broken layout.\n8. Given no products are provided, then the component does not render.\n\nAccessibility\n\n9. The section header uses an appropriate heading level in context.\n10. The component meets WCAG 2.1 AA."
