    {
      "id": "18258",
      "key": "SFCC-150",
      "summary": "PDP UI — Coming Soon, Back in Soon, Unavailable (All Sizes)",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to see clear product state messaging on the PDP when a product is Coming Soon, Back in Soon, or entirely unavailable across all sizes,\nso that\n I understand the product's availability and what actions are available to me.\nImage for reference - (Figma leading):\nIn the dropdown - they can click Notify Me for a size:\nThis story covers the PDP UI for three product-level states:\nComing Soon\n — product displayed before stock has been added or purchase is enabled. State is driven by custom product attribute in SFCC (out of stock status, start and end dates) + inventory (zero inventory for all size variants)\nBack in Soon\n — product has sold out but will restock imminently (re-cut). State is driven by custom product attribute in SFCC (out of stock status, start and end dates) + inventory (zero inventory for all size variants)\nUnavailable — \nall size variants are out of stock. State is derived from zero inventory across all variants and custom product attribute is set to the default status “Unavailable”, no need to check start and end dates - those are only relevant for Coming Soon, Back in Soon.\nIn all three states the UI behaviour is consistent: the standard size selector is displayed with text “Select size to get notified” and in the dropdown, with a \"Notify Me\" CTA per individual size row. \nThe primary CTA area displays the relevant state label (e.g. \"COMING SOON, BACK IN SOON, UNAVAILABLE\") and Add to Bag is suppressed. Selecting a size and activating Notify Me opens the Notify Me slide-out (SFCC-149).",
