      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to register for a back-in-stock notification from the PDP when my selected size is unavailable,\nso that\n I am alerted by email when my size is restocked and can return to purchase.\nThis story covers the end-to-end Notify Me flow as experienced on the PDP: triggering the slide-out panel, submitting the registration form, and the post-submission confirmation state. Component build and accessibility implementation are covered in SFCC-741 (pdp/notify-me). The back-end email trigger and stock replenishment integration are out of scope — see SFCC-183 and SFCC-182.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):",
