      "id": "18513",
      "key": "SFCC-266",
      "summary": "PDP – Slide Out – EU Environmental Qualities",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \nI want \nto see environmental qualities information for a product on the PDP, \nso that \nI can make informed purchasing decisions in line with EU product transparency requirements.\nThe PDP displays an Environmental Qualities accordion tab on the EU storefront - specifically today for the locales en-EU and en-FR (technical limitation that in SFCC we cannot name it en-EU, pending decision \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-151\n ). That decision shouldn’t block this user story - the requirement is clear - we should be able to set this link on PDP / tab on the slide out relevant per locale.\nThe tab must only render when the \nenvironmentalNotes\n attribute is populated on the product in SFCC (sourced from AP21 via MuleSoft). If not relevant for the locale, the tab must be entirely suppressed — no empty state, placeholder, or generic copy may be shown. Content is authored upstream in AP21 by the Zimmermann merchandising team. This story covers conditional render logic and data binding only. Dependent on \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-26\n for creating the attribute.",
